{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"9d124bccb18c7356","__entryId":"fade","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:118px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:62%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:84%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:46%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:224px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">新建项目</div>\n          <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-bottom:10px\" value=\"秋季营销落地页\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">创建</button></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:8px\">遮罩与弹窗同步淡入，并用轻微位移表达进入方向</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;max-width:176px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:16px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px\">\n        <span style=\"background:#1d2129;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">✓ 保存成功</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">入场 fade-in，时长按任务调整</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;max-width:176px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:16px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px\">\n        <span style=\"background:#1d2129;color:#fff;font-size:12px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px;opacity:.3;transform:translateY(-5px)\">✓ 保存成功</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">退场 fade-out，可采用更快节奏</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"max-width:330px;margin:0 auto\">\n        <div class=\"demo-tabs\" style=\"max-width:none\">\n          <span class=\"tab\">简介</span>\n          <span class=\"tab active\">评论 12</span>\n          <span class=\"tab\">相关文章</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"position:relative;height:66px\">\n          <div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:10px;opacity:.22\">\n            <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:96%;margin-bottom:7px\"></i>\n            <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>新消息</b>：通过短暂入场动效提示列表新增了一项</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:4px\">旧内容（残影）淡出、新内容淡入，交叉淡化不打断视线</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px\">\n        <div style=\"width:138px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;opacity:.4\">\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;height:34px;margin-bottom:8px\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%;margin-bottom:6px\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:45%\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center\">fade-in<br>300ms<br>→</span>\n        <div style=\"width:150px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/cover-mountain.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:40px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:7px 10px\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">周末徒步路线</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">阅读约 4 分钟</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:10px\">首屏内容整体淡入 + 轻微上移，不闪不跳</div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:118px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:62%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:84%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:46%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:224px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">New project</div>\n          <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-bottom:10px\" value=\"Autumn Marketing Landing Page\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Cancel</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Create</button></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:8px\">The mask fades in synchronously with the pop-up window, and uses slight displacement to express the entry direction</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;max-width:176px;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:16px 10px;display:flex;flex-direct