interrupt the line of sight</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px\">\n        <div style=\"width:138px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;opacity:.4\">\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:100%;height:34px;margin-bottom:8px\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%;margin-bottom:6px\"></i>\n          <i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:45%\"></i>\n        </div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center\">fade-in<br>300ms<br>→</span>\n        <div style=\"width:150px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/cover-mountain.png\" style=\"width:100%;height:40px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n          <div style=\"padding:7px 10px\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Weekend hiking route</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Read about 4 minutes</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:10px\">The first screen content fades in as a whole + moves up slightly, without flashing or jumping</div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"fade-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"opacity\"><span class=\"fade-anat-frames\"><i class=\"fade-anat-f1\"></i><i class=\"fade-anat-f2\"></i><i class=\"fade-anat-fr f3\"></i></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"offset\"><span class=\"fade-anat-tag\">transform: translateY(8px)</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"duration\"><span class=\"fade-anat-tag\">animation-duration: .2s</span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"fade-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"opacity\"><span class=\"fade-anat-frames\"><i class=\"fade-anat-f1\"></i><i class=\"fade-anat-f2\"></i><i class=\"fade-anat-fr f3\"></i></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"offset\"><span class=\"fade-anat-tag\">transform: translateY(8px)</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"duration\"><span class=\"fade-anat-tag\">animation-duration: .2s</span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"opacity","cn":"透明度","en":"Opacity","desc":"从 0 到 1，控制元素由透明变为可见","desc_en":"Opacity changes from 0 to 1, taking the element from transparent to visible"},{"key":"offset","cn":"轻微位移","en":"Offset","desc":"入场配上移几像素，更自然","desc_en":"A small translate offset gives the entering element a more natural motion"},{"key":"duration","cn":"时长","en":"Duration","desc":"按内容距离、任务紧迫度与减少动态效果偏好设定，不存在通用固定毫秒数","desc_en":"There is no universal duration; choose one based on travel distance, task urgency, and reduced-motion preferences."}]},"variants":[{"cn":"纯淡入","en":"Pure Fade","demo":"<span class=\"fade-v-row\"><i class=\"fade-v-fr fade-v-o1\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-fr fade-v-o2\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-fr\"></i></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"fade-v-row\"><i class=\"fade-v-fr fade-v-o1\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-fr fade-v-o2\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-fr\"></i></span>","when":"遮罩与占位内容安静出现","when_en":"For overlay or placeholder content that should appear without drawing attention"},{"cn":"淡入上移","en":"Fade In Up","demo":"<span class=\"fade-v-row\"><i class=\"fade-v-fr fade-v-u3\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-fr fade-v-u1\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-fr\"></i></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"fade-v-row\"><i class=\"fade-v-fr fade-v-u3\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-fr fade-v-u1\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-fr\"></i></span>","when":"卡片弹窗入场，最自然","when_en":"For a card or modal entering the page"},{"cn":"交叉淡化","en":"Cross Fade","demo":"<span class=\"fade-v-cross\"><i class=\"fade-v-old\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-new\"></i></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"fade-v-cross\"><i class=\"fade-v-old\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-new\"></i></span>","when":"轮播与 Tab 内容切换","when_en":"For switching carousel or tab content"}],"use":[{"t":"让弹窗或卡片以渐入配合轻微位移出现","m":"fade-in-up"},{"t":"<b>退场可比入场更短</b>：是否更快及具体时长要按任务、距离与减少动态效果设置验证","m":"fade-out-fast"},{"t":"<b>内容切换交叉淡化</b>：{c:tabs}、轮播旧出新进，视线不断","m":"fade-swap"},{"t":"<b>优先考虑 opacity 和 transform</b>：它们通常能避免布局变化，仍应按实际性能验证","m":"fade-opacity"}],"dont":[{"t":"<b>层级变化只用 fade</b>：菜单可能缺少来源线索，需要时结合缩放或位移表达方向","m":"fade-hierarchy","bad":true},{"t":"fade 时长与任务不匹配：<b>过长会拖慢操作感，过短又可能看不清变化</b>；不要套固定毫秒数","m":"fade-slow","bad":true},{"t":"透明度为 0 时仍可能挡住点击，要同时处理交互状态","m":"fade-ghost","bad":true},{"t":"<b>所有变化都只用 fade</b>：会削弱缩放、滑页等交互原本的层级与方向信息","m":"fade-everything","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"Toast 出现和离开只需要轻微淡入淡出，但透明为 0 后仍会挡住后面的按钮。应该怎样修？","options":[{"id":"fade-with-interaction-state","label":"过渡透明度，并在离开完成时同步移除点击、焦点和占位状态","feedback":"Fade 负责视觉变化，交互和最终隐藏状态仍要同步处理，透明元素才不会继续挡路。","correct":true},{"id":"opacity-only-hidden","label":"只把 opacity 设为 0，继续保留原来的层级和点击区域","feedback":"透明度为零并不移除元素，它仍可能覆盖按钮、占据空间或被键盘聚焦。","correct":false},{"id":"directionless-drawer-fade","label":"把所有浮层都统一成纯淡入淡出，包括需要表达侧边来源的抽屉","feedback":"Toast 适合轻淡化，但抽屉等层级变化可能需要位移说明方向，不能用一个效果覆盖所有场景。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A toast only needs a light fade in and out, but after reaching zero opacity it still blocks a button underneath. How should it be fixed?","options":[{"id":"fade-with-interaction-state","label":"Transition opacity and remove hit testing, focus, and layout presence when exit completes","feedback":"Fade owns the visual change, while interaction and final hidden state must synchronize so transparency stops blocking content.","correct":true},{"id":"opacity-only-hidden","label":"Only set opacity to zero and keep the original layer and click area","feedback":"Zero opacity does not remove an element; it may still cover buttons, occupy space, or receive keyboard focus.","correct":false},{"id":"directionless-drawer-fade","label":"Use pure fading for every overlay, including drawers that need to communicate a side origin","feedback":"A toast suits light fading, but drawers may need movement to explain direction and should not share one universal effect.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请让 Toast 用 opacity 做短暂淡入淡出，离开完成后从交互和焦点顺序中移除，不能继续挡住页面。支持减少动态效果，并分别测试进入、可见、退出中和已移除四个状态。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Give the toast a brief opacity fade and remove it from hit testing and focus order after exit, so it cannot block the page. Support reduced motion and test entering, visible, exiting, and removed states."}},"references":[{"title":"opacity 属性","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/opacity","title_en":"opacity"}],"scenes":["弹窗与遮罩入场","提示出现与消失","Tab 内容切换","页面内容初次呈现"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Show or hide an overlay","m":"fade-in-up"},{"t":"Replace a small piece of content","m":"fade-out-fast"},{"t":"Introduce a toast or status message","m":"fade-swap"},{"t":"Soften a non-spatial state change","m":"fade-opacity"}],"dont":[{"t":"Fade critical content so slowly that work is delayed","m":"fade-hierarchy","bad":true},{"t":"Use opacity to hide an element that remains unexpectedly interactive","m":"fade-slow","bad":true},{"t":"Combine large movement with every fade","m":"fade-ghost","bad":true},{"t":"Use repeated fades around text people are reading","m":"fade-everything","bad":true}],"scenes":["Overlay","Toast","Image loading","Content swap"],"sceneUI":["<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:118px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:62%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:84%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:46%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:224px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:6