\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:10px\">The first screen content fades in as a whole + moves up slightly, without flashing or jumping</div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<span class=\"fade-v-row\"><i class=\"fade-v-fr fade-v-o1\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-fr fade-v-o2\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-fr\"></i></span>","when":"For overlay or placeholder content that should appear without drawing attention"},{"demo":"<span class=\"fade-v-row\"><i class=\"fade-v-fr fade-v-u3\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-fr fade-v-u1\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-fr\"></i></span>","when":"For a card or modal entering the page"},{"demo":"<span class=\"fade-v-cross\"><i class=\"fade-v-old\"></i><i class=\"fade-v-new\"></i></span>","when":"For switching carousel or tab content"}]},"usageMocks":{"fade-in-up":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:24px;height:16px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;opacity:.15;transform:translateY(5px)\"></span><span style=\"width:24px;height:16px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;opacity:.5;transform:translateY(2px)\"></span><span style=\"width:24px;height:16px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">fade-in 配合轻微位移，可表达进入方向</span>","fade-out-fast":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">入场较缓</span><span class=\"mk-tag green\">退场较快</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">进入与离开的节奏可按任务分别调整</span>","fade-swap":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"position:relative;width:44px;height:18px\"><span style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:#e5e6eb;border-radius:3px;opacity:.4\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px;opacity:.8\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">旧的淡出，新的淡入</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">内容切换交叉淡化，不打断视线</span>","fade-opacity":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">opacity</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">transform</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">这两个属性通常能避免触发布局变化</span>","fade-hierarchy":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"position:relative\"><span class=\"mk-select\">全部状态<i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span><span class=\"mk-drop\" style=\"position:absolute;top:26px;left:10px;opacity:.55\"><span class=\"mk-opt\">全部状态</span><span class=\"mk-opt on\">进行中</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);margin-top:34px\">菜单只原地淡入，缺少来源与方向线索</span></div>","fade-slow":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">fade</span><span class=\"mk-progress\" style=\"flex:1;width:auto\"><i style=\"width:30%\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">时长过长</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">淡入过慢会延迟内容可用感</span></div>","fade-ghost":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"position:relative\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:55%\"></i><span style=\"position:absolute;inset:8px;border:1px dashed var(--red);border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">opacity: 0 了还占位，挡住下面的点击</span></div>","fade-everything":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag red\">弹窗 fade</span><span class=\"mk-tag red\">缩放 fade</span><span class=\"mk-tag red\">滑页 fade</span></div><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:68%\"></i><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">所有变化都只用 fade，会削弱层级与方向线索</span></div>"}}}